</div>
<h2 class="wprm-recipe-name wprm-block-text-bold">Pumpkin Cream Cold Foam</h2>
<div class="wprm-spacer"></div>

<div class="wprm-spacer"></div>
<div class="wprm-recipe-summary wprm-block-text-normal"><span style="display: block;">This pumpkin cream cold foam recipe has the perfect amount of pumpkin and sweetness. It&#039;s so easy to make at home and it&#039;s the perfect dupe to the Starbucks Pumpkin Cream cold foam.</span></div>
<div class="wprm-spacer"></div>

<div class="wprm-spacer" style="height: 25px;"></div>
