omykitchen.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/espressomykitchen-cafe-de-olla-mexican-spiced-coffee-1x1-1-180x240.jpg 180w, https://www.espressomykitchen.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/espressomykitchen-cafe-de-olla-mexican-spiced-coffee-1x1-1-640x853.jpg 640w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 360px) 100vw, 360px" /><div class="fsri-title">Café de olla</div></a></li><li class="listing-item"><a href="https://www.espressomykitchen.com/iced-dirty-chai-latte/"><img width="360" height="480" src="https://www.espressomykitchen.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/espressomykitchen-iced-dirty-chai-latte-1x1-1-360x480.jpg" class="feast_3x4_thumbnail fsri-image wp-post-image" alt="dirty chai with vanilla cold foam" data-pin-nopin="true" fetchpriority="low" aria-hidden="true" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.espressomykitchen.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/espressomykitchen-iced-dirty-chai-latte-1x1-1-360x480.jpg 360w, https://www.espressomykitchen.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/espressomykitchen-iced-dirty-chai-latte-1x1-1-720x960.jpg 720w, https://www.espressomykitchen.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/espressomykitchen-iced-dirty-chai-latte-1x1-1-180x240.jpg 180w, https://www.espressomykitchen.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/espressomykitchen-iced-dirty-chai-latte-1x1-1-640x853.jpg 640w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 360px) 100vw, 360px" /><div class="fsri-title">Iced Dirty Chai Latte</div></a></li><li class="listing-item"><a href="https://www.espressomykitchen.com/iced-apple-crisp-shaken-espresso/"><img width="360" height="480" src="https://www.espressomykitchen.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/espressomykitchen-apple-crisp-oatmilk-shaken-espresso-1x1-1-360x480.jpg" class="feast_3x4_thumbnail fsri-image wp-post-image" alt="oat milk being poured over the apple crisp shaken espresso" data-pin-nopin="true" fetchpriority="low" aria-hidden="true" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.espressomykitchen.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/espressomykitchen-apple-crisp-oatmilk-shaken-espresso-1x1-1-360x480.jpg 360w, https://www.espressomykitchen.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/espressomykitchen-apple-crisp-oatmilk-shaken-espresso-1x1-1-720x960.jpg 720w, https://www.espressomykitchen.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/espressomykitchen-apple-crisp-oatmilk-shaken-espresso-1x1-1-180x240.jpg 180w, https://www.espressomykitchen.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/espressomykitchen-apple-crisp-oatmilk-shaken-espresso-1x1-1-640x853.jpg 640w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 360px) 100vw, 360px" /><div class="fsri-title">Iced Apple Crisp Shaken Espresso</div></a></li></ul></div></div><footer class="entry-footer"></footer></article><section class="author-box"><img alt='' src='https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/90d3f7648215eab4a63d8a9e61e9e8963960ec946b1883a12546a946697778ac?s=70&#038;d=mm&#038;r=g' srcset='https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/90d3f7648215eab4a63d8a9e61e9e8963960ec946b1883a12546a946697778ac?s=140&#038;d=mm&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-70 photo' height='70' width='70' loading='lazy' decoding='async'/><h4 class="author-box-title">About <span itemprop="name">Ana</span></h4><div class="author-box-content" itemprop="description"><p>More about me - I love photography and eating good food while balancing motherhood and drinking lots of coffee on the side. I'm the biggest cat lover and enjoy living a healthy lifestyle, BUT also indulge in moderation.</p>
