			<p class="comment-meta"><time class="comment-time">September 30, 2024 at 11:04 am</time></p>		</header>

		<div class="comment-content">
			
			<p>Hi Becky, I've used with warm lattes and don't see a problem with pouring over hot chocolate. If you try it let me know how you like it - the combo of hot chocolate and pumpkin cold foam sounds delightful 🙂</p>
		</div>

